Description: 4k intro for Linux by Luminaire, released in 2017
 Häiriökuilo is a 4k intro released by Luminaire at Assembly 2017,
 where it ended 7th in the combined 4k competition.
 .
 The intro uses OpenGL, SDL 1.2 and cairo. The music is written as raw
 audio on the standard output and played with aplay.
